. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jqLa-MTTEi0Q7kNvwH28uDd&_nc_oc=Admqi1YxzPKn1a19cqTdDq9OL1FqI1vxoYWrH3JNXXZ3_3BFh_mwwAiO5ksBSqce5Ls&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv_PS2NaUP1GHKTUYm7zhLJAktfnCOBZfkKCgvGsrzMXw&oe=6999ACBE"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1KeZVqfTm0oQ7kNvwEdUV3I&_nc_oc=AdnCU3dmnc7nFvs5zds9EGrEdM4iWg4E_5q3jZpzpCB8A2f8489szt8XVUeRPh44B2c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuveCzzQLUMkqIYk8RwGmWHln7PGx5-QkPoLjYUUZm0Rg&oe=69998B1E"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JOYktqlqD_sQ7kNvwG_qAZI&_nc_oc=AdnnVp2aAvBnSrub5eExthorZLUZ9Qqy5VwtOqNAgL3dWvTqliunRcuFPiTrmkzr648&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftebxxQBXKc8wEfqT43gM0df1pj2c05m9FNOa3m3MMPGA&oe=6999B8DB"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-2